12. /**
13.  * Compatibility-aware draft merge: when the live questionnaire has changed
14.  * since a draft was stored, restore every answer that still fits and NAME
15.  * what doesn't — never discard the whole draft, never drop silently. Pure
16.  * decision layer behind every restore path (`fillDraftStore.ts`'s
17.  * `loadFillDraft` and `mergeDraftIntoSeed`); see `mergeDraftResponses`
18.  * for the carry-over rules.
