183.  *    DROPPED (`type_changed`), the whole response — a type change
184.  *    invalidates the answer's meaning, not just its encoding.
185.  *  - A structured question whose `structured_type` differs from what the
186.  *    draft recorded -> DROPPED (`type_changed`) at this same whole-
187.  *    response level, before `useStructuredRows` (per-`rowId` baseline
