189.  *    verbatim; `useStructuredRows`' `droppedEdits` channel then names any
190.  *    individual row a refetched baseline no longer has — this function
191.  *    only decides whether the section applies at all.
192.  *  - Choice/quantity: entries whose stored value/coding no longer matches
