178.     // Per-form signature cache, keyed by form.key. A keystroke only ever
179.     // changes the ONE store that fired, so comparing just that form's own
180.     // cached entry is sufficient — no other form's signature could have
181.     // changed, so there is nothing to gain from joining them into a
182.     // session-wide value.
