18. /**
19.  * What a federation plugin contributes to make a structured question type
20.  * of its own. The same contract as a core `StructuredTypeDefinition`
21.  * (`./types.ts`), minus the compile-time key correlation core enjoys: a
22.  * plugin's data shape is opaque to the host, so its entries arrive as
